--- !u!114 &672726883
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 672726880}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9c8aa15d8ba34bbda97d077fc21920ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueTrigger
  dialogueController: {fileID: 641856271}
  speakerName: "OBO-REF 9000 \u2014 SWITZERLAND vs MALI, CURLING MATCH"
  lines:
  - "\u201CBEEP. Match initialized. Switzerland versus Mali. May the least stupid
    rock win.\u201D\n\n\u201CSwiss team releases the stone\u2026 smooth delivery.
    Annoyingly precise. Very Swiss.\u201D\n\n\u201CMali is sweeping like the damn
    ice owes them money.\u201D\n\n\u201CWARNING: That stone is drifting harder than
    my faith in human competence.\u201D\n\n\u201CExcellent shot by Mali! Target acquired.
    Swiss stone absolutely screwed.\u201D\n\n\u201CSwitzerland answers with a perfect
    draw. Oh, for fuck\u2019s sake, that was clean.\u201D\n\n\u201CBEEP BEEP. Sweeping
    intensity detected: unnecessarily violent.\u201D\n\n\u201CMali launches the rock\u2026
    too much power! Congratulations, you\u2019ve nearly sent it to France.\u201D\n\n\u201CSwiss
    skip is calculating the angle. I calculated it six seconds ago, meatbag.\u201D\n\n\u201CCONTACT!
    Stone-on-stone impact. Finally, some violence in this polite-ass sport.\u201D\n\n\u201CMeasurement
    required. Nobody move. Especially you, Switzerland. I see that broom.\u201D\n\n\u201CResult:
    Switzerland by 2.3 millimeters. Yes, millimeters. Stop complaining.\u201D\n\n\u201CMali
    preparing the hammer. Pressure level: high. My emotional involvement: still zero.\u201D\n\n\u201CBeautiful
    takeout! Holy shit. Mali just deleted that Swiss stone from existence.\u201D\n\n\u201CFinal
    rock incoming\u2026 sweep, sweep, SWEEP, you magnificent lunatics!\u201D\n\n\u201CBEEEEEP!
    Match over. Nobody punched anybody, so apparently this counts as a successful
    curling event.\u201D\n\n\u201CFinal verdict: excellent curling, questionable
    shouting, fantastic brooms.\u201D\n\n\u201CROBO-REF 9000 signing off. Please
    get your slippery rocks off my ice."
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  startAutomatically: 0
  saveCountryName: 0
