--- !u!114 &885876700
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 885876698}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9c8aa15d8ba34bbda97d077fc21920ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueTrigger
  dialogueController: {fileID: 641856271}
  speakerName: John "The Organizer"
  lines:
  - "Alright, welcome to the 2344 Olympic Curling Games, you magnificent bunch of
    ice-sweeping lunatics.\n\nLooks like every damn delegation has already made it
    here, which is honestly a miracle considering half of you came from the other
    side of the planet.\n\nNow, I\u2019m supposed to welcome you properly, tell everyone
    who we\u2019re representing, wave the right flag, all that official crap...\n\nOnly
    problem is, I have absolutely no idea which delegation we are.\n\nCould you remember
    your damn name ?"
  - "So yeah... welcome, whoever the hell we are.\n\nGood luck out there, try not
    to smash anyone\u2019s teeth with a curling stone, and let\u2019s make these
    Games one hell of a show.\n\nOh, and apparently the pools are already over anyway.
    But you all look like a pretty decent bunch, so screw it \u2014 you can go straight
    on to face the last teams still in the running. \n\nIf you finish first against
    the Bronze Team, then the Silver Team, you\u2019ll earn the right to face the
    Golden Team."
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d8ea4d2b6454df4490dd58df9141a02, type: 3}
  startAutomatically: 1
  saveCountryName: 1
